        }
      ],
      "title": "#2 过去的碎片"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3132001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "哎呀呀，才几天没见，大人的气色看起来不太好呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "怎么，还有谁没来么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "大人，您要见我？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "颜料的事，你们知道多少？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "我在FULI商店亲眼看见，送去的货出现了严重瑕疵。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "……属下只是刚刚得知这件事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "这是不是意味着，大人的复仇大计会……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "你还真是，怎么都学不会讨大人的开心呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "我找你们来，就是为了这个。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "我们目前研制的涂料的确不成功。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "它只是一件拙劣的不成熟的模仿，却几乎让我们费尽了心血。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "我承认我们是不成熟的拙劣的模仿……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "那么，真正的神奇涂料究竟在哪儿呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "大人不是说过这个世界上早就没有真正的神奇涂料了么……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "不，还有最后一个办法能够找到真正的神奇涂料。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "但前提是，你们要把她抓过来见我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "她是……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "她可以提供与真正的神奇涂料有关联的最后一个线索。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "要不惜一切代价给我抓过来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "是，遵命。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3132021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "……遵命，我的大人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-158",
