      "title": "#3 复仇的渴望"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3133001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "我找到可以恢复樱的办法了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "真的？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "这是真的吗，简直想做梦一样……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "我仔细研究了一下樱身上那层神秘涂料的涂装方式，有几个地方想找莉可确认。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "我说过，我会全力配合你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "你在给樱涂抹神秘涂料的时候，是如何操作的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "好像没有什么特别的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "我就是在樱的身上另外涂抹了一层涂料而已……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "也就是说，你没有破坏掉她原来的那层涂装，对吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "是这样，我没有进行过其他的操作。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "嗯，好，有这些信息就足够了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "什么意思呀，我没有听明白……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "樱身上最外层的这层涂装方式很特殊，这对于我们来说非常有利。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "如果想要帮助樱恢复原来的样子，只需要清除最外层的涂装就可以了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "原来如此……原来如此……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "那我们该怎么做才能清除掉樱身上最外层的涂装？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "需要调制一种针对神奇涂料的清洁剂。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "配方我已经研究出来了，可是需要的材料还缺不少……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "这个好办，交给我们姐妹两个吧~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "还有我，我也要帮忙~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "那就多谢你们了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3133022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "终于看到希望了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-159",
