      ],
      "title": "#4 神秘之水"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3134001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "玲快看，这些是你需要的材料吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "我来检查一下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "你们做得很棒，制作清洁剂的材料都在这里了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "我准备开始给樱清洗外层的涂料，你们要一起来吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "要要要，快带我们一起过去！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "你们都是樱很熟悉的朋友，恢复原貌之后，有你们在的话她会安心很多。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "我和小惠才是樱的朋友，你不是！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "在清洗外层涂料的过程中，我需要你们帮我按压住樱的身体，能做到吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "……我会尽力的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "樱，我要开始了哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "吼吼……杀……杀……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "会有一点点疼，要忍耐一下哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134014",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "嘶……吼吼吼~！！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "即使樱反抗，也要按住她，拜托了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "……好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134017",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "吼吼吼~！！！！啊啊啊啊~！！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "樱，只差最后一点了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "吼吼~！！吼……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "都结束了，你们做得很好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "清洗樱身上外层涂装的工作，多亏了你们在，进行得非常顺利。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3134024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "太好了……呜呜……真是太好了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
